{
  "description": "Every visual setting for generated resumes lives here. Change a value, then ask your assistant to refresh the templates (operation docs.refresh-templates) to refresh the Word masters in '3 Templates'. Values come from the two-page research-program resume style: Times New Roman, centred name, grey rules under headings, right-aligned dates.",
